 <h3> <a href="/OpenForum/Actions/RJSC">RJSC</a> </h3>

 <!--Extension InsertPage page="/OpenForum/Actions/RJSC" section="1" -->
       
<p>Remote JavaScript Call - executes server-side JavaScript code</p>

<b>Get parameters</b>
<ul><li> code = JavaScript code to execute on the server</li>
<li> queueName = Optional queue name for output messages</li>
</ul>
<b>Get examples:</b>
<xmp class="panel" of-exclude="true">
