 <h3> <a href="/OpenForum/Actions/RefreshPage">RefreshPage</a> </h3>

 <!--Extension InsertPage page="/OpenForum/Actions/RefreshPage" section="1" -->
       
<p>Refreshes a page by regenerating HTML from its wiki markup</p>

