<hr/>

 <h3> <a href="/OpenForum/Actions/Update">Update</a> </h3>

 <!--Extension InsertPage page="/OpenForum/Actions/Update" section="1" -->
       
<p>Saves a page's wiki source and rebuilds the page</p>

<b>Post parameters</b>
<ul><li> pageName = Page name to update</li>
<li> source = Wiki markup source content</li>
<li> tags = Page tags (comma-separated)</li>
</ul>
<b>Post example:</b>
<xmp class="panel" of-exclude="true">
// Using JSON.post
JSON.post('/OpenForum/Actions/Update', null, 
  'pageName=/MyPage&source='   encodeURIComponent('<h3>My Page<br/>n<br/>n<p>Content</p>')   </h3>
  '&tags=documentation,wiki')
  .onSuccess(function(result) {
    console.log('Page updated');
  }).go();
</xmp>

<!--End Extension InsertPage page="/OpenForum/Actions/Update" section="1" --><br />


<hr/>

 <h3> <a href="/OpenForum/Actions/UpdateJarManager">UpdateJarManager</a> </h3>

 <!--Extension InsertPage page="/OpenForum/Actions/UpdateJarManager" section="1" -->
       
<p>Updates and refreshes the JAR manager to reload Java libraries</p>

